            "body": "Hi all,\n\nA few notes before we meet at 11:\n\n1. The agenda surface still stacks every source in one column. I'd like to try two columns above 1100px and see how the merged table sits over them.\n2. We need copy for an app that answers with nothing. Right now its slot just stays empty.\n3. Mei, could you bring the latest spacing tokens?\n\nScreenshots are in the review doc. See you at 11.\n\nIdris"
